{"sha": "4f4b0f3e8abae96e10e44b233cdf17099e2dd9416b0f506533d74bb82c91c3e1", "body": ["\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g11:quad:inequality}", "求解 $-x^2 + 3x + 4 \\geq 0$。这里 $\\Delta = 9 + 16 = 25$，根为", "$\\frac{-3 \\pm 5}{-2}$，即 $x_1 = -1$ 与 $x_2 = 4$。由于", "$a = -1 < 0$，三项式在两根之外为负，", "在两根之间为正。由于是非严格不等式，解集为", "$\\intcc{-1}{4}$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{抛物线}", "", "\\begin{definition}[抛物线]\\label{def:g11:quad:parabola}", "二次函数 $f(x) = a(x-\\alpha)^2+\\beta$ 的图像是一条", "\\emph{抛物线}\\index{抛物线}，其\\emph{顶点}为 $S(\\alpha, \\beta)$。", "当 $a > 0$ 时开口向上，$a < 0$ 时开口向下，且关于", "竖直直线 $x = \\alpha$ 对称。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{remark}", "对称性易于验证：对任意 $h$，", "$f(\\alpha + h) = ah^2 + \\beta = f(\\alpha - h)$，因此与直线 $x = \\alpha$ 水平距离相等的两点", "高度相同。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=5.1cm, height=4.8cm,", "  xmin=-0.8, xmax=4.4, ymin=-1.7, ymax=3.6,", "  xtick={1,3}, xticklabels={$x_1$,$x_2$}, ytick=\\empty,", "  title={$\\Delta > 0$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=-0.15:4.15] {(x-1)*(x-3)};", "  \\fill (axis cs:1,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (axis cs:3,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (axis cs:2,-1) circle (1.5pt) node[below, font=\\small] {$S$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}%", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=5.1cm, height=4.8cm,", "  xmin=-0.8, xmax=4.4, ymin=-1.7, ymax=3.6,", "  xtick={2}, xticklabels={$x_0$}, ytick=\\empty,", "  title={$\\Delta = 0$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0.2:3.8] {(x-2)^2};", "  \\fill (axis cs:2,0) circle (1.5pt)", "    node[above right=1pt, font=\\small] {$S$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}%", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=5.1cm, height=4.8cm,", "  xmin=-0.8, xmax=4.4, ymin=-1.7, ymax=3.6,", "  xtick=\\empty, ytick=\\empty,", "  title={$\\Delta < 0$}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0.35:3.65] {(x-2)^2 + 0.8};", "  \\fill (axis cs:2,0.8) circle (1.5pt) node[below, font=\\small] {$S$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 开口向上的抛物线（$a > 0$）相对于", "$x$ 轴的三种位置：两个根、一个重根、无根。顶点 $S$ 的横坐标为", "$\\alpha = -\\frac{b}{2a}$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=8.6cm, height=5.6cm,", "  xmin=-2.2, xmax=5.4, ymin=-4.4, ymax=6.2,", "  xtick={-1,4}, xticklabels={$x_1$,$x_2$}, ytick=\\empty]", "  \\addplot[name path=par, omDef, thick, domain=-1.75:4.75, samples=80]", "    {-0.8*(x+1)*(x-4)};", "  \\path[name path=xaxis] (-1.75,0) -- (4.75,0);", "  \\addplot[omDef!20] fill between[of=par and xaxis,", "    soft clip={domain=-1:4}];", "  \\fill (axis cs:-1,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (axis cs:4,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\node[font=\\small, omDef] at (axis cs:1.5,2.0) {$f > 0$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omThm] at (axis cs:-1.75,-1.3) {$f < 0$};", "  \\node[font=\\small, omThm] at (axis cs:4.75,-1.3) {$f < 0$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 有两个根的开口向下三项式（$a < 0$）的符号：", "两根之间（阴影部分）取 $-a$ 的符号，两根之外取 $a$ 的符号。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[抛物线的作图]\\label{met:g11:quad:reading}", "作 $f(x) = ax^2+bx+c$ 的图像：先确定开口方向（$a$ 的符号）、", "顶点 $\\left(-\\frac{b}{2a},\\, f\\!\\left(-\\frac{b}{2a}\\right)\\right)$、", "点 $(0, c)$ 为与 $y$ 轴的交点，以及根（若有）。", "对称轴 $x = -\\frac{b}{2a}$ 使每个已算出的点都在图像上出现两次。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}", "对 $f(x) = x^2 - 4x + 3$：开口向上，顶点 $(2, -1)$，与 $y$ 轴", "相交于 $(0,3)$，根为 $1$ 与 $3$（观察可得 $1 - 4 + 3 = 0$）。由对称性，", "点 $(4, 3)$ 也在图像上，是 $(0, 3)$ 的对称点。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g11:quad:1}", "解下列方程", "\\[", "x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0, \\qquad", "2x^2 + 3x - 2 = 0, \\qquad", "x^2 + 2x + 5 = 0, \\qquad", "9x^2 - 6x + 1 = 0 .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}